---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Lab" description="Research infrastructure: HPC Platform and National Space Weather Platform at USACH.">

<section>
  <span class="section-title">Infrastructure</span>
  <h1>Lab</h1>
  <p class="lead">Computing infrastructure and monitoring platforms for heliophysics and space weather research.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--border-accent);margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <h3>⚡ High-Performance Computing Platform</h3>
    <p><strong>FONDEQUIP EQM230160 Project</strong> · PI: Dr. Victor Pinto · 2024-2027</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.5rem">High-performance computing platform for data science, simulations, and numerical modeling. Supporting research in space physics, machine learning, and plasma simulations.</p>
    <p class="meta"><a href="https://fisica.usach.cl/es/plataforma-de-investigacion-hpc" target="_blank">HPC platform website →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--border-accent);margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <h3>🛰️ National Space Weather Platform</h3>
    <p><strong>FONDEF IDEA I+D Project</strong> · PI: Dr. Victor Pinto · 2025-2027</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.5rem">Chile's first pilot platform for real-time space weather monitoring and early warnings. In collaboration with Universidad Adventista de Chile.</p>
    <ul style="margin:0.75rem 0 0 1.5rem">
      <li>Real-time solar wind data monitoring</li>
      <li>Magnetic fields and particles in Earth's magnetosphere</li>
      <li>Deep learning predictive models</li>
      <li>Magnetic perturbation forecasting and GIC risk prediction</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="section-title">Data sources</span>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Satellites</h3>
      <p>Van Allen Probes (MagEIS, REPT, EMFISIS, EFW) · THEMIS (SPEDAS) · GOES · OMNI</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Ground magnetometers</h3>
      <p>SAMBA · MACCS · THEMIS GBO · CARISMA · SuperDARN</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Tools</h3>
      <p>Python (SciPy, Pandas, Numpy, Matplotlib, SpacePy) · TensorFlow-Keras · PyTorch · Scikit-learn</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>